(label "GND" (at 462.28 270.51 180) (effects (font (size .9 .9)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ee6ec605-6645-50fd-ab66-7972b2f206c2"))
(text "Independent USB power only. J_EVM pin 2 (5V) NC. No DUT supply on carrier.\nLED1-5 GP4-8. INA229 SPI0 GP16-19. SD SPI1 GP12-15.\nU_SD input: USB VBUS (physical 40). EN: Pico 3V3. SD_3V3 is separate.\nCard CMD and DAT0-3 have 10k pull-ups to SD_3V3; CLK has no pull-up.\nNo card-detect switch. Buffered logger firmware is a separate milestone.\nInterposer cable straight-through; EVM R1 DNP. Bench validation pending." (at 220 385 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "3c0a9f1d-7be4-5de2-ae2d-031d05b797d9"))
)
